{
  "_createdAt": "2026-04-27T19:14:50Z",
  "_id": "wp-post-135096-en",
  "_rev": "Kra5TYIFOKLIQlRCd8Hobx",
  "_type": "article",
  "_updatedAt": "2026-07-05T16:12:57Z",
  "author": {
    "_ref": "author-legacy-archive",
    "_type": "reference"
  },
  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "000000000001",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000000",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Travel from the USA to Egypt covers distance."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000003",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000002",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Even from the East Coast it is a long flight; from the West Coast or Midwest, with connections, can become a full-day move. So when choosing travel packages, look calmly at transfer load, on-ground flow, and inclusions beyond price."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000005",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000004",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt travel packages are convenient. International flights, hotels, airport transfers, domestic movement, guide, Nile cruise, and major site visits combined give first travellers reassurance."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000007",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Not all packages hold the same value. Cheap doesn't always mean good; expensive doesn't always mean deep travel."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000009",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What matters is whether the package matches your time, stamina, and interest."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Basic routes from the USA to Egypt"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bduurdelzhz6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Going from the USA to Egypt, most travellers arrive at "
        },
        {
          "_key": "rdyu6gns0uqe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "g7921q8whgz2"
          ],
          "text": "Cairo"
        },
        {
          "_key": "ilfy69m07yvy",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " International Airport. Cairo is the entry to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "wf40coy1mut1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "ev31l9mni7wy"
          ],
          "text": "Giza"
        },
        {
          "_key": "z6u2jqs5551j",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " pyramids and the Grand Egyptian Museum, and a base for domestic flights and trains to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "x8afyogtas8e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "kek6wujdsj8s"
          ],
          "text": "Luxor"
        },
        {
          "_key": "4yyeu9obf0jf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "_key": "39eff26s13ce",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "i4vjl9t5ip8n"
          ],
          "text": "Aswan"
        },
        {
          "_key": "veywqlexyy4q",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", and Red Sea direction."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "g7921q8whgz2",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "ev31l9mni7wy",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "kek6wujdsj8s",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58877",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        },
        {
          "_key": "i4vjl9t5ip8n",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58758",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000000f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000000e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "From around New York, direct flights to Cairo can be an option. From most US cities, connecting via European, Middle Eastern, or Turkish hub airports is common."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000011",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000010",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "From LA, San Francisco, Chicago, Dallas, Atlanta, Miami, total travel time, fatigue, and arrival time vary greatly by connection point. Beyond airline name, confirm connection time, late-night or early-morning arrival, and whether you connect to a domestic flight the same day."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000013",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Some Egypt itineraries move to Luxor or Aswan right after arrival. Connections after long-haul flights are affected by delays and fatigue. For first-timers, staying one night in Cairo before heading south can be easier."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000015",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Strengths of flight-included packages"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000017",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Flight-included Egypt packages have clear advantages."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000019",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "First, arrangement is simple. With international flights, hotels, airport transfers, domestic movement, and guide combined, no jumping between booking sites. For first Egypt visitors, families, older travellers, honeymoons, and anniversary trips especially, this reassurance is big."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Next, trouble contact becomes one window. For flight delay, airport transfer, domestic-flight change, or hotel problem, who to contact on-site is clear."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "eh8px8k4etlx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For short schedules touring multiple cities, built-in local movement helps greatly. To build Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "scumntcptnn0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "26kn1mq8v9gt"
          ],
          "text": "Abu Simbel"
        },
        {
          "_key": "h7bvwnu2rn5q",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", and Nile cruise in around ten days, the local order needs careful thought."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "26kn1mq8v9gt",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-56813",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000001f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Packages suit those reducing arrangement load, reducing wandering time on-site, and efficiently touring major destinations."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000021",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cautions on flight-included packages"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000023",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Flight-included packages have cautions too."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000025",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000024",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The biggest weakness is flexibility. With set itineraries, wanting another day in Luxor or to reduce Red Sea may not change easily."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000027",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Flight conditions can be hard to see. Which airline, what connection time, baggage included, seat selection, change or cancellation. Always confirm."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000029",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For hotels, \"5-star,\" \"deluxe,\" \"Nile view\" alone don't judge. Without confirming hotel name, room type, location, and refurbishment, expectation and reality can gap."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "13o58lid9ygn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Some packages don't include entries or supplementary tickets. "
        },
        {
          "_key": "7wmcr3jy4u0v",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "44gefy8ae51y"
          ],
          "text": "Valley of the Kings"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5bd65ubcugj5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", GEM, Great Pyramid interior, Nefertari's tomb, and Seti I's tomb can have extras separate from standard."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "44gefy8ae51y",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.valley-of-the-kings",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The cheaper-looking the package, the more important to see what isn't included."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000002f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000002e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Booking flights yourself and arranging only locally"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000031",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000030",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For many US travellers, realistic and usable is booking flights yourself and asking local company or specialist agency for only Egyptian-domestic arrangements."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000033",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000032",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This lets you choose airline, miles, seats, connections, and departure airport. Depending on US departure point, finding better times or prices by searching flights yourself is sometimes easier."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000035",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000034",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For Egypt arrival airport transfer, hotels, domestic flights, Nile cruise, guide, car, and site visits, leave to locally strong companies. Combining long-haul flight freedom and local-operation reassurance."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000037",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000036",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This form suits experienced travellers, those using airline miles, those choosing business or premium economy themselves, and those with detailed schedule preferences."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000039",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000038",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A very practical middle ground between full package and full self-arrangement."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Points to see in the itinerary"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When comparing US-departure Egypt packages, don't judge by day count alone. Same 10 days varies greatly inside."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000003f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000003e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "First, see whether arrival and departure days are substantially usable for sightseeing. With US long-haul, first and last days are often mostly transfer. Labelled 10 days, actual sightseeing days can be around 7."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000041",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000040",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Next, see how many nights in Cairo, Luxor, and Aswan. Packing pyramids and museum into Cairo one-night busies. Luxor one-night struggles to see the west bank deeply."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000043",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000042",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If Nile cruise included, confirm ship name, nights, port stops, and sightseeing inclusion. Cruise ships differ greatly in atmosphere and cabin quality."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000045",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000044",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If Red Sea included, see whether it is rest time or just adding movement. Forcing Red Sea into short itineraries can cut Cairo or Luxor time."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000047",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000046",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How many days for first-timers"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000049",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000048",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Coming from the USA, don't make Egypt stay too short. Given transfer distance, under a week on-site becomes quite rushed."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "pwedekhco3n4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "At minimum, around 7 nights centred on Cairo and Luxor. Lets you see Giza, GEM, Karnak, "
        },
        {
          "_key": "mm78hvuav5f5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "7s9mc2zelabz"
          ],
          "text": "Luxor Temple"
        },
        {
          "_key": "dk2bgfa1xcbn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Valley of the Kings, and major west-bank sites."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "7s9mc2zelabz",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "guideArticle.luxor.the-luxor-temple",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000004c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "More natural is around 10 to 12 days. Makes Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, Nile cruise, and Abu Simbel combine easier."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000004f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "kvqh7rm55f8s",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For Red Sea rest, 12 to 14 days makes it easier. After walking Cairo and Luxor, several days at "
        },
        {
          "_key": "qr9rm4bfomnx",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "3kjtpklt0m9b"
          ],
          "text": "Hurghada"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0gkbti715m2j",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " or Sharm el-Sheikh keeps trip fatigue from accumulating."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "3kjtpklt0m9b",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000051",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c25rrjo6k5r0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "With more than two weeks, adding Siwa, White Desert, or "
        },
        {
          "_key": "19pajnxq3bh2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "tpadkv0k7zws"
          ],
          "text": "Alexandria"
        },
        {
          "_key": "0yfx3qjxx4im",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " becomes possible. No need to include all. With US long-haul, over-packing is the most likely failure."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "tpadkv0k7zws",
          "_type": "internalLink",
          "reference": {
            "_ref": "wp-page-58750",
            "_type": "reference"
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000053",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000052",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Season and flights"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000055",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000054",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Suited for Egypt travel is roughly October to April. Cairo, Luxor, and Aswan outdoor sightseeing eases — usable season for first trips especially."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000057",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000056",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "December and January have good climate but overlap with year-end travel demand, raising flight and hotel costs. Crowds increase."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000059",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000058",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "November, February, March balance weather and crowd. For first US-departure trips, particularly easy to consider."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "May to September brings harsh heat in Luxor and Aswan. Flights and hotels may drop; site sightseeing needs early-morning centring. Choosing only summer cheap can be stamina-hard on-site."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Red Sea-centred trips work in summer; consider separately from Cairo or Upper Egypt site sightseeing."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000005f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000005e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Visa and entry preparation"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000061",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000060",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "US citizens need a visa to enter Egypt. Official information shows arrival visa or e-visa as options for tourism. Conditions and prices can change; before departure, confirm on Egypt's official e-visa site and US State Department travel information."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000063",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000062",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Passport validity matters too. Most cases require a minimum validity period at entry. Confirm before booking, not just before travel."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000065",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000064",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For family trips, confirm children's passports, single-parent travel consent letters, insurance, medication, and emergency contacts. Even with flight-included packages, entry-document responsibility often remains on travellers."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000067",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000066",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What good packages should include"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000069",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000068",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Good Egypt packages clearly show what is included."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If international flights, airline, flight number or route, connection point, baggage, seat class, and change conditions known."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For hotels, name, city, nights, room type, breakfast inclusion, and conditions like Nile view known."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000006f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000006e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For local movement, airport transfer, inter-city movement, domestic flights, train, car, and cruise range clear."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000071",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000070",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For sightseeing, which sites entered, guide accompaniment, entry inclusion, and supplementary-ticket separation clear."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000073",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000072",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For Nile cruise, confirm ship name, nights, cabin category, food, port stops, and guide accompaniment range."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000075",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000074",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Finally, see whether tips, visa, travel insurance, drinks, personal spending, and extra activities included. Vague here means more payment on-site."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000077",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000076",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Package expressions to watch"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000079",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000078",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Travel ads have appealing but vague words."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000007b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000007a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Written \"luxury\" without hotel name can't judge. Written \"Nile cruise included\" without ship quality and cabin category can't compare. Written \"guide included\" without specialism or accompaniment time unclear."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000007d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000007c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Written \"pyramid sightseeing\" doesn't always include pyramid interior. Written \"Valley of the Kings\" doesn't always include Tutankhamun or Seti I. Written \"Grand Egyptian Museum\" needs confirming ticket conditions and visit range."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000007f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000007e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Watch packages with many shopping stops. Visiting papyrus, perfume, alabaster, or carpet shops isn't bad. When it cuts site time, trip value drops."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000081",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000080",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "See itinerary time allocation, not ad words. The package's real character shows there."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000083",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000082",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Safety and travel insurance"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000085",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000084",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt's major tourist routes have long reception records. Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, and Red Sea resorts are areas many travellers visit."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000087",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000086",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Situations inside Egypt vary by area. For Sinai Peninsula, desert, and border zones, confirm US State Department latest travel information and local regulations. Package inclusion doesn't remove safety-confirmation need."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000089",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000088",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Always consider travel insurance. Long-haul flights, domestic movement, cruise, illness, delay, cancellation, medical evacuation — insurance holds practical meaning in Egypt travel."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000008b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000008a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When choosing insurance, confirm medical fees, trip interruption, cancellation, baggage, flight delay, pre-existing conditions, and activity coverage range. The pricier the package, the more important to understand cancellation conditions and insurance relation in advance."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000008d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000008c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Who packages suit"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000008f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000008e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Flight-included packages suit first Egypt travellers, those unused to overseas travel, families, and those wanting to efficiently tour major destinations in short schedule."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000091",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000090",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Also fit honeymoons and anniversary trips where you don't want to be caught up in local arrangement. Airport pickup, hotel, guide, and domestic movement organised greatly reduces travel tension."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000093",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000092",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For those wanting to use airline miles, choosing hotels themselves, taking much free time, or changing long-stay plans, full packages can be tight."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000095",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000094",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Then, taking only international flights yourself and leaving Egypt-domestic to specialist companies fits."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000097",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000096",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Practical checklist when comparing"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "000000000099",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000098",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "When comparing packages, always confirm:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000009b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000009a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Departure and arrival airports. Connection points and connection times. Arrival time and first-day plan."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000009d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000009c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Hotel name, room type, food conditions, location."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "00000000009f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "00000000009e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How many nights in Cairo, Luxor, Aswan, and Red Sea."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000a1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000a0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Nile cruise ship name, nights, cabin category, port stops."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000a3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Guide qualification, language, accompaniment days."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000a5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000a4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Entry inclusion range and where supplementary tickets are needed."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000a7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000a6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Free time amount. Shopping-stop presence."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000a9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000a8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Whether visa, tips, insurance, drinks, and personal spending included."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000ab",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000aa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Cancellation terms, payment conditions, emergency contacts."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000ad",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000ac",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Companies answering these properly likely sell with itinerary understanding. With vague answers, even attractive prices need careful thought."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000af",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000ae",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What matters for US-departure trips"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000b1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000b0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Coming from the USA, transfer distance is part of itinerary design."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000b3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000b2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Don't put pushy sightseeing on arrival-day afternoon. Don't stack domestic flights immediately after long-haul. In Luxor and Aswan, use early morning and rest after midday. If including Red Sea, place at the end. Such small decisions greatly change overall satisfaction."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000b5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000b4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Egypt isn't a country that increases value the faster you tour. Pyramids, temples, tombs, museums, Nile, desert, sea each hold time depth."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0000000000b7",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "0000000000b6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A good package edits them into unstrained order, not just lists. With US long-haul considered, choose by whether you can properly see on arrival, not by cheap."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    }
  ],
